•ability to attract and retain qualified talent, including our senior management team;

•termination of or changes to our MGA programs;

•delays in remittance from insurance carriers and our inability to collect receivables from insurance carriers;

•risks associated with the acquisition or disposition of businesses and the integration of acquired businesses;

